% Sample entries so the bibliography renders. Replace with your own.
%
% This file shipped as 0 bytes in the template, which is why the Bibliography
% page came out empty: Typst printed the heading, but there was nothing to
% list. An UNCITED entry is not printed either -- write an at-sign followed by
% the key in your text to cite it, the way thesis.typ cites the Adams entry.
%
% Careful: an at-sign starts a new entry ANYWHERE in this file, including in a
% comment line such as this one, so never write a citation key in a comment.

